    static int maxZoomForTile( const QgsRectangle &tileExtent, const QList<QgsTileExtentMaxZoomRegion> &regions, int defaultMaxZoom );
%Docstring
Evaluates the effective maximum zoom level for a given ``tileExtent``.

If the tile intersects one or more regions, the LARGEST maxZoom among
all intersecting regions is returned. If no region covers the tile,
``defaultMaxZoom`` is returned.

.. warning::

   This method requires that the CRS for ``tileExtent`` and ALL ``regions`` is equal. The caller
   must take care to transform all ``regions`` to a matching CRS in advance.
%End

